// Sightless Mind (RG_RAID): the reference EF_TEIHIT3 (276) bursts twenty thin
// blue lens1 streaks outward from the caster over ~0.55s after a 0.1s delay.
// lens1 renders boxy here, so the streaks are blue glow11 slivers. Plays once
// per cast on the caster; the server owns the Stun/Blind riders. ~0.65s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the unit's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
